{"case_id":"multi-fact-compare-007","question":"112 學年度資工系與經濟系一年級必修有哪些課重疊？","expected_answer":"112學年度資工系與經濟系一年級必修重疊課程為：微積分1、微積分2、微積分3。經濟系的「微積分4 ─ 在經濟商管的應用」與資工系的「微積分4」名稱不同，因此不算同名重疊。","expected_status":"answered","allow_unknown":false,"expected_answer_contains":["微積分1","微積分2","微積分3","微積分4 ─ 在經濟商管的應用","微積分4"],"expected_source_ids_any":["9020-required-courses-112-grade-1","3030-required-courses-112-grade-1"],"expected_retrieved_chunk_ids_any":["9020-required-courses-112-grade-1-list","3030-required-courses-112-grade-1-list"],"tags":["comparison","required-courses","csie","econ","112","grade-1"]}
{"case_id":"multi-fact-compare-008","question":"資工系 111 與經濟系 112 微積分1、微積分2、微積分3 的課號是否相同？","expected_answer":"相同。資工系111與經濟系112的微積分1/2/3課號皆分別為：微積分1=MATH4006、微積分2=MATH4007、微積分3=MATH4008。","expected_status":"answered","allow_unknown":false,"expected_answer_contains":["相同","MATH4006","MATH4007","MATH4008"],"expected_source_ids_any":["9020-required-courses-111-grade-1","3030-required-courses-112-grade-1"],"expected_retrieved_chunk_ids_any":["9020-required-courses-111-grade-1-course-001","9020-required-courses-111-grade-1-course-002","9020-required-courses-111-grade-1-course-003","3030-required-courses-112-grade-1-course-001","3030-required-courses-112-grade-1-course-002","3030-required-courses-112-grade-1-course-003"],"tags":["comparison","required-courses","csie","econ","111","112","course-code","calculus"]}
{"case_id":"multi-fact-compare-009","question":"經濟系總體經濟學原理在 111–114學年度學分是否改變過？","expected_answer":"沒有改變。經濟系111、112、113、114學年度入學的一年級必修「總體經濟學原理與實習」皆為4學分（課號 ECON1021）。","expected_status":"answered","allow_unknown":false,"expected_answer_contains":["沒有","改變","4學分","ECON1021"],"expected_source_ids_any":["3030-required-courses-111-grade-1","3030-required-courses-112-grade-1","3030-required-courses-113-grade-1","3030-required-courses-114-grade-1"],"expected_retrieved_chunk_ids_any":["3030-required-courses-111-grade-1-course-004","3030-required-courses-112-grade-1-course-006","3030-required-courses-113-grade-1-course-006","3030-required-courses-114-grade-1-course-006"],"tags":["comparison","required-courses","econ","111","112","113","114","credits","macro"]}
{"case_id":"multi-fact-compare-010","question":"資工系二年級必修在 113、114 分別列出","expected_answer":"資工系二年級必修如下。\n- 113學年度：線性代數、機率、演算法設計與分析、系統程式設計、作業系統（共5門，15學分）。\n- 114學年度：線性代數、機率、演算法設計與分析、系統程式設計、作業系統（共5門，15學分）。","expected_status":"answered","allow_unknown":false,"expected_answer_contains":["113","114","線性代數","機率","演算法設計與分析","系統程式設計","作業系統","5門","15學分"],"expected_source_ids_any":["9020-required-courses-113-grade-2","9020-required-courses-114-grade-2"],"expected_retrieved_chunk_ids_any":["9020-required-courses-113-grade-2-list","9020-required-courses-114-grade-2-list"],"tags":["comparison","required-courses","csie","113","114","grade-2"]}
{"case_id":"multi-fact-compare-011","question":"資工系 113 學年度所有年級必修總覽","expected_answer":"資工系（113學年度入學）各年級系訂必修總覽如下：\n- 一年級：微積分1、微積分2、微積分3、微積分4、普通物理學甲上、普通物理學甲下、普通物理學乙、普通物理學乙上、普通物理學乙下、普通物理學丙上、普通物理學丙下、普通物理學丁、普通化學甲上、普通化學甲下、普通化學乙上、普通化學乙下、普通化學丙、資料結構與演算法、計算機程式設計、普通生物學甲上、普通生物學甲下、普通生物學乙、普通生物學乙上、普通生物學乙下、普通生物學丙（共25門，65學分）。\n- 二年級：線性代數、機率、演算法設計與分析、系統程式設計、作業系統（共5門，15學分）。\n- 三年級：人工智慧導論、專題研究、計算機系統實驗、計算機網路實驗、計算機網路、自動機與形式語言、計算機結構（共7門，18學分）。\n- 四年級：查無課程資料。","expected_status":"answered","allow_unknown":false,"expected_answer_contains":["一年級","二年級","三年級","四年級","微積分1","線性代數","人工智慧導論","查無課程資料"],"expected_source_ids_any":["9020-required-courses-113-grade-1","9020-required-courses-113-grade-2","9020-required-courses-113-grade-3","9020-required-courses-113-grade-4"],"expected_retrieved_chunk_ids_any":["9020-required-courses-113-grade-1-list","9020-required-courses-113-grade-2-list","9020-required-courses-113-grade-3-list","9020-required-courses-113-grade-4-list"],"tags":["overview","required-courses","csie","113"]}
